CLIENT & DELIVERY GUIDE

1. Project scope

Real-Estate-01 V1 is a static real-estate showcase/catalogue website.

Pages:

Home

Properties

Property Detail

About

Contact

Main actions:

Call

WhatsApp

Get Directions

Share

Enquire / Visit

V1 intentionally has no:

Admin panel

Database

Login

Payment

Checkout

Cart

Order management

Inventory management

Online booking engine

